{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/102-fu-tian/fangyurun-yuanshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/102-fu-tian/fangyurun-yuanshi/data.json","title":"诗经原始(上下) · 甫田 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 齊風 · 甫田 · 汇集《诗经原始(上下)》关于《甫田》的 4 条注释，含 4 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"102-fu-tian","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/102-fu-tian/fangyurun-yuanshi","poem":{"id":"102-fu-tian","title":"甫田","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"qifeng","path":["風","齊風","甫田"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"無田甫田","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"維莠驕驕","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"無思遠人","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"勞心忉忉","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"無田甫田","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"維莠桀桀","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"無思遠人","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"勞心怛怛","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"婉兮孌兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"總角丱兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"未幾見兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"突而弁兮","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi","title":"诗经原始(上下)","authors":["方玉润","李先耕"],"contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","era":"清","publicationYear":1986,"carrier":"EPUB"},"stats":{"annotationCount":4,"glossCount":4},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"未詳。","targetNotes":"篇首题注。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 篇首题注。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"题注"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"右《甫田》三章，章四句。此詩詞義極淺，盡人能識。惟意旨所在，則不可知。《小序》謂「刺襄公」。《大序》謂「無禮義而求大功，不修德而求諸侯」。率皆擬議之詞，非實據也。《集傳》不從，是矣。而順文敷義，又恐非詩人本旨。且前二章與後一章，詞氣全不相類，此中必有所指，與泛言義理者不同。《集傳》勉强串合，終非自然。故何玄子以爲「刺魯莊公」，末章似是，其如上二章何哉？姚氏以爲「未詳」，識過諸儒遠矣，從之。","targetNotes":"总评原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 总评段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评"}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"田耕治之也。〔孔氏穎達曰〕「田甫田」，猶《多方》「宅爾宅，田爾田」，今人謂佃食，古之遺語也。甫大也。莠害苗之草也。驕驕張皇之意。忉忉憂勞也。桀桀猶驕驕也。怛怛慘切貌。婉孌少好貌。丱兩角貌。弁冠名。","targetNotes":"集释原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集釋"}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"驕二蕭。忉四豪。通韻。桀九屑。怛七曷。通韻。孌十七霰。丱十六諫。見十七霰。弁同。轉韻。","targetNotes":"标韵原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标韵段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"標韻"}]}]}}}
